ype=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"800\" src=\"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/Mr.-Stephen-Lai-819x1024.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-31375\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/Mr.-Stephen-Lai-819x1024.png 819w, https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/Mr.-Stephen-Lai-240x300.png 240w, https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/Mr.-Stephen-Lai-768x960.png 768w, https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/Mr.-Stephen-Lai.png 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-696a863f elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"696a863f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h6 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Mr. Stephen Lai <\/h6>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-58688ec9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"58688ec9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Visiting Professor of Entrepreneurship<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-2350d40\" data-id=\"2350d40\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7756c9ac elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"7756c9ac\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>An ASEAN-focused Serial Entrepreneur, Mr. Stephen Lai is a former multinational executive who has spent over 30 years accumulating cross-cultural business experience and extensive global people networks while overseeing offices in Singapore (HQ), Hong Kong, Shanghai, Shenzhen, Kuala Lumpur, Bangkok, Saigon and Mumbai, and pioneering large scale commodity and investment conferences in ten major cities across Asia. An EXCO member of the ASEAN Economic Club and Business Adviser to KSI. Strategic Institute for Asia Pacific, Stephen is currently Chairman of Malaysia-China (Greater Bay Area) Science-Tech Innovation Alliance and Founder-President of Penang-Chengdu Friendship Association.\u00a0 During 2012-2014, he was tasked to promote internationalization of China enterprises under the Belt and Road Initiative when he was appointed Executive Adviser to the Director of China Council for the Promotion of International Trade Shenzhen Municipal Committee, who was concurrently President of China (Shenzhen) International Chamber of Commerce. In addition, Stephen served as Deputy Director on the China (Shenzhen) Financial Expo and Conference Planning Committee chaired by Shenzhen Mayor for 5 years.\u00a0\u00a0A business mentor and fund raising adviser to tech start-up CEO\u2019s in Silicon Valley, Singapore and Penang, Stephen also actively consults with Chinese Enterprises in the areas of international business and partnership development in ASEAN countries. A former Adviser to BuonMaThuot Coffee Exchange Centre, Vietnam\u2019s first commodity exchange, Stephen\u2019s varied international career includes a stint as Chief Representative (ASEAN) for one of China\u2019s largest fintech solution providers listed on the Shanghai Stock Exchange, Regional Business Development roles with global financial information giant Reuters, Investment Technology Manager with Koeneman Capital Management &#8211; Asia\u2019s first quant-based boutique investment firm founded by former Head of Equities at Government Investment Corporation (GIC) of Singapore- and Business Consultant to Singapore Government\u2019s premier ICT R&amp;D Centre, Kent Ridge Digital Lab (later renamed A*STAR). An Industrial Adviser and Adjunct Professor at DRB-HICOM University of Automotive. Malaysia, Stephen is an Industrial Entrepreneurship Fellow at the Universiti Sains Malaysia (USM).\u00a0 He earned an MBA from the Ross School of Business at the University of Michigan at Ann Arbor and double degrees in Mathematics and Electrical Engineering from the University of Texas at Austin. A former ASEAN Scholar in Singapore, Penang-born Stephen is a Certified Career. Coach and enjoys training youths in the areas of Resilience and leadership. Development and Social Entrepreneurship. During 2018-2021, he served as Strategic Adviser to Penang State Minister for Trade, Industry and Entrepreneur Development in his home state in Malaysia.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-48c575d elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-gap-beside-yes elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-column-vertical-align-stretch\" data-id=\"48c575d\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-extended\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-1cebec12\" data-id=\"1cebec12\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-45f902b6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"45f902b6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.d